@startuml UC-A02 Main Sequence Communication Diagram
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam handwritten false
skinparam maxMessageSize 150
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FEFECE
skinparam noteBorderColor #E0E000
skinparam arrowColor #000000
skinparam actorBorderColor #000000
skinparam actorBackgroundColor #FEFECE

title UC-A02: Manage Users - Main Sequence Communication Diagram
note right of Admin
  **Scenario**: Admin views user and suspends account
  **Objects**: 8 participating objects
  - 1 boundary (UserManagementInteraction)
  - 3 entity (User, Booking, Review)
  - 1 control (UserManagementControl)
  - 3 application logic (Validator, Notifier, Audit)
end note

' ============================================
' PARTICIPANTS
' ============================================
actor Admin as admin
participant ": UserManagementInteraction" as ui
participant ": UserManagementControl" as control
participant ": UserStatusValidator" as validator
participant ": UserNotificationService" as notifier
participant ": AuditLogger" as audit
participant ": User" as user
participant ": Booking" as booking
participant ": Review" as review

' ============================================
' SEQUENCE 1: VIEW USERS
' ============================================
== 1. View User List ==

admin -> ui: 1: User Management\n(Navigate to user management)
activate ui
note right: Trigger: Admin navigates to\n"User Management"

ui -> control: 1.1: List Request\n(Get all users)
activate control
note left: Boundary to Control

control -> user: 1.2: Get Users\n(Query user list)
activate user
user --> control: 1.3: User List\n(Return users)
deactivate user

control -> ui: 1.4: Display Table\n(Show user table)
deactivate control

ui -> admin: 1.5: Show Users\n(Display users)
deactivate ui

' ============================================
' SEQUENCE 2: SEARCH USER
' ============================================
== 2. Search User ==

admin -> ui: 2: Search User\n(Search by email/name/phone)
activate ui

ui -> control: 2.1: Search Query\n(Search criteria)
activate control

control -> user: 2.2: Search Users\n(Search users)
activate user
user --> control: 2.3: Search Results\n(Matching users)
deactivate user

control -> ui: 2.4: Display Results\n(Show results)
deactivate control

ui -> admin: 2.5: Show Results\n(Display search results)
deactivate ui

' ============================================
' SEQUENCE 3: VIEW USER DETAILS
' ============================================
== 3. View User Details ==

admin -> ui: 3: Select User\n(Click on user)
activate ui

ui -> control: 3.1: User Details\n(Request user details)
activate control

control -> user: 3.2: Get User\n(Get user data)
activate user
user --> control: 3.3: User Data\n(User details)
deactivate user

par Fetch Related Data
    control -> booking: 3.4: Get Bookings\n(Get user's bookings)
    activate booking
    booking --> control: 3.5: User Bookings\n(Booking list)
    deactivate booking
and
    control -> review: 3.6: Get Reviews\n(Get user's reviews)
    activate review
    review --> control: 3.7: User Reviews\n(Review list)
    deactivate review
end

control -> ui: 3.8: Display Profile\n(Show full profile)
deactivate control

ui -> admin: 3.9: Show Profile\n(Display profile)
deactivate ui

note right of admin
  User profile displayed with:
  - Basic information
  - Booking history
  - Review history
  - Activity log
end note

' ============================================
' SEQUENCE 4-5: SUSPEND USER
' ============================================
== 4-5. Suspend User ==

admin -> ui: 4: Suspend User\n(Click suspend)
activate ui

ui -> control: 4.1: Suspend Request\n(Suspend request)
activate control

control -> validator: 4.2: Validate Suspend\n(Validate suspension)
activate validator
validator --> control: 4.3: Can Suspend\n(Can suspend user)
deactivate validator

control -> ui: 4.4: Request Reason\n(Ask for reason)
deactivate control

ui -> admin: 4.5: Show Reason Prompt\n(Display reason input)
deactivate ui

admin -> ui: 5: Enter Reason\n(Enter suspension reason)
activate ui

ui -> control: 5.1: Suspend Reason\n(Reason + duration)
activate control

control -> user: 5.2: Update Status\n(Set status to suspended)
activate user
user --> control: 5.3: Status Suspended\n(Status updated)
deactivate user

control -> audit: 5.4: Log Action\n(Log status change)
activate audit
audit --> control: 5.5: Action Logged\n(Action logged)
deactivate audit

control -> notifier: 5.6: Notify User\n(Email user)
activate notifier
notifier --> control: 5.7: Notification Sent\n(Email sent)
deactivate notifier

control -> ui: 5.8: Suspend Complete\n(Suspension done)
deactivate control

ui -> admin: 5.9: Show Suspended\n(Display confirmation)
deactivate ui

note right of admin
  **User Suspended Successfully**
  - Status updated to "suspended"
  - User notified via email
  - Audit log created
  - Bookings preserved
end note

' ============================================
' OBJECT SUMMARY
' ============================================
note over admin, review
  **Participating Objects (8)**

  **Boundary (1)**:
  - :UserManagementInteraction

  **Entity (3)**:
  - :User
  - :Booking
  - :Review

  **Control (1)**:
  - :UserManagementControl

  **Application Logic (3)**:
  - :UserStatusValidator
  - :UserNotificationService
  - :AuditLogger
end note

@enduml
